# Development Rules

- No database, React, or TypeScript in v1.
- No hardcoded secrets; do not commit `.env` or credential files.
- No `git push --force` to `main` or `master`.
- Do not call external LLM APIs from `retro-api` — AI runs in Cursor (`/analyze-retro` → import endpoint).
- Bug fixes require a regression test; new service behavior requires unit tests; API changes require integration tests.
- Do not delete tests to make CI pass.
